    "summary": "Use it in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit picks its targets.\n\nPick a **HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY** unit of yours, other than a **DAMNED** unit, that at least 1 of those attacks targets. For the rest of the phase, whenever an enemy unit finishes its attacks, roll a D6 for every melee attack it allocated to your unit, up to 6 D6 per attacking unit. Each 4+ inflicts 1 **[mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** on that attacking unit.",
